@GosubResetWitchBook Path:System/System_ResetWitchBook Version:1

@BeginIf Expression:isDebugDirectJump
    @Gosub Path:Act02_Chapter06/Act02_Chapter06_TrialInit
    @HidePerspectiveStageScreen Index:1 Duration:0 Reset:true
    @ModifyBackgroundExtended TintColor:#000000 Duration:0 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:Transparent SubId:Overlay

@SetTrialTimer Time:900
@HideUI UINames:ControlPanel AllowToggle:false
@ShowUI UINames:DebateUI

; ==============================================================================
; MARK: 11-7: 💬 大魔女の動機
; ==============================================================================
; ＠ト書き▼議論11-7
; 議論開始カットイン
; BGM継続：AccUhEarts(Vocal無)
@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_15_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0

# Judge11-7-1

@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-First
@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-Effect
@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-Last
@ChangeTrialPauseMode Enable:false ProcessTimer:true

@HidePerspectiveStageScreen Index:1 Reset:true

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Yuki.2
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Yuki Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:我们魔女一直隐居在这座孤岛上，<br>过着与世无争的生活。|#0206Trial07_Yuki001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Yuki.18
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Yuki Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:虽然曾经和人类有过一些交流，<br>但我们魔女之间协商后，<br>还是决定不再干涉<br>人类的生活。|#0206Trial07_Yuki002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Yuki.4
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Yuki Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:人类无法使用魔法，<br>是比魔女低级的<br>种族……<br>正因如此，我们才决定守望他们，<br>认为那才是我们<br>该扮演的角色。|#0206Trial07_Yuki003| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Yuki.17
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Yuki Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:可惜……<br>那是个错误的判断。|#0206Trial07_Yuki004| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Yuki.17
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Yuki Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:当人类的文明得以飞速发展，<br>他们却反过来袭击了我们的岛屿。|#0206Trial07_Yuki005| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Yuki.13
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Yuki Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:我们在岛上固守防御，<br>拼命抵抗……|#0206Trial07_Yuki006| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Yuki.13
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Yuki Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"可人类却使用了<br>抓人质、毒药、偷袭等卑劣手段，<br>逐一捕获、<br><link=\"Objection_02_06_07_01\">处决</link>了<br>我们的同胞。|#0206Trial07_Yuki007|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Yuki.14
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Yuki Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"到头来，<br>其他魔女<br>全都<link=\"Objection_02_06_07_02\">不在了</link>，<br>只剩我独活至今。|#0206Trial07_Yuki008|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Yuki.17
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Yuki Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:她们一定<br>心有不甘吧。<br>一定悔恨万分吧。|#0206Trial07_Yuki009| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Yuki.18
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Yuki Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"如今，<br><link=\"Objection_02_06_07_03\">知晓她们心情的</link>……<br>已经只有我一个了。|#0206Trial07_Yuki010|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Yuki.13
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Yuki Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"我身上背负着<br><link=\"Objection_02_06_07_04\">所有死去魔女</link>的<br>恨意。|#0206Trial07_Yuki011|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Yuki.17
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Yuki Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"正因如此，<br>哪怕只是<link=\"Objection_02_06_07_05\">消极</link>的执念，<br>我也无法停下……<br>我<br><link=\"Objection_02_06_07_06\">不可以</link>停下。<br>|#0206Trial07_Yuki012|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4


@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.EndDebate-First
@ChangeTrialPauseMode Enable:true ProcessTimer:true
@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.EndDebate-Effect
@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.EndDebate-Last

